{%- comment -%}
  Master shade -> hex map for Makeup City variants, built from the store's
  eyedropped swatch colors. Outputs the 7-char hex for a known shade name, or
  nothing if unmapped. Lookup is O(1) via string `contains` -- every entry is
  ;name:#RRGGBB (name lowercased, single-spaced).

  Usage:
  {%- capture hex -%}{% render 'kj-shade-hex', shade: variant.title %}{%- endcapture -%}
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign kj_key = shade | downcase | strip -%}
